  "rules": [
    "r.command_seq is real shared command round; r.status.seq is monotonic UART frame sequence. Heartbeat advances only the latter.",
    "normalized speed is a command accumulator, PWM is an MCU-reported command, neither is measured RPM. r.measured_rpm is null.",
    "Raw servo feedback is not centidegrees. Missing/null/fresh=false stays unavailable/stale; do not divide by100 or invent 360/4096 calibration.",
    "For ordinary status/welcome/legacySTOP use status.* only; common command fields may be absent. Host-specific receipt wrappers are outside this B wire-level object.",
